#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:7
msgid "Multi-Objective Optimization"
msgstr "多目的最適化"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:9
msgid ""
"Solve multi-objective optimization problems with trade-offs between "
"objectives, using `saealib`."
msgstr "`saealib` を使って、目的間のトレードオフがある多目的最適化問題を解きます。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:11
msgid ""
"`minimize()` uses default components based on the number of objectives. "
"Use `Optimizer.set_*()` to configure the algorithm, surrogate model, or "
"evaluation strategy individually."
msgstr ""
"`minimize()`は目的関数の数に応じたデフォルトのコンポーネントを使います。 アルゴリズム、代理モデル、評価戦略を個別に設定する場合は "
"`Optimizer.set_*()` を使います。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:14
msgid ""
"This page covers what's specific to problems with two or more objectives:"
" choosing a comparator and extracting the Pareto front."
msgstr "このページでは、2つ以上の目的を持つ問題に固有の内容として、Comparatorの選択とParetoフロントの取得を扱います。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:16
msgid "What you'll be able to do"
msgstr "このページでできるようになること"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:19
msgid ""
"By the end of this page, you'll be able to choose a Comparator for a "
"multi-objective problem and extract the resulting Pareto front."
msgstr "このページを終えると、多目的問題でComparatorを選び、得られたParetoフロントを取り出せます。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:22
msgid ""
"For the basic single-objective procedure, use [Single-objective "
"optimization](single_objective.md); if you need a custom Comparator, see "
"[Custom components](custom_components.md). This page runs a multi-"
"objective `Problem`, selects a Comparator, and extracts the Pareto front."
msgstr ""
"単目的問題の基本手順は [単目的最適化](single_objective.md) を使い、独自の Comparator が必要な場合は "
"[独自コンポーネント](custom_components.md) を参照してください。このページでは、多目的 `Problem` "
"を実行し、Comparatorを選択してParetoフロントを取得します。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:25
msgid "Set up the problem"
msgstr "Problemを準備する"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:27
msgid ""
"When multiple objective functions are in a trade-off relationship, there "
"exist solutions where improving one worsens another."
msgstr "複数の目的関数がトレードオフの関係にあると、一方を改善すると他方が悪化する解が存在します。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:29
msgid ""
"Under this relationship, the set of solutions not dominated by any other "
"solution in every objective is called the **Pareto front**."
msgstr "この関係において、すべての目的で他の解に支配されない解の集合を **Paretoフロント** と呼びます。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:31
msgid "Here, as an example, we minimize the ZDT1 function built into `saealib`."
msgstr "ここでは例として、`saealib` に組み込まれたZDT1関数を最小化します。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:39
msgid ""
"`zdt1` is a `Problem` instance returning a two-objective benchmark "
"problem with a convex Pareto front."
msgstr "`zdt1` は、凸型のParetoフロントを持つ2目的のベンチマーク問題を返す `Problem` インスタンスです。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:41
msgid "Run minimize"
msgstr "minimizeを実行する"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:43
msgid ""
"Passing a `Problem` instance directly carries over the number of "
"objectives from it."
msgstr "`Problem` インスタンスを直接渡すと、そこから目的数が引き継がれます。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:54
msgid ""
"Where `result.x`/`result.f` were a single point in the single-objective "
"case, in the multi-objective case they become multiple solutions forming "
"the Pareto front."
msgstr "単目的の場合に1点だった `result.x`/`result.f` は、多目的の場合にはParetoフロントを形成する複数の解になります。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:56
msgid "Configure an Optimizer"
msgstr "Optimizerを構成する"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:58
msgid ""
"With `Optimizer(problem)`, you can configure each component "
"independently. `set_*()` returns the same `Optimizer` for chaining, and "
"`run()` or `iterate()` executes the optimization."
msgstr ""
"`Optimizer(problem)`では、各コンポーネントを独立して設定できます。 `set_*()`は連鎖呼び出しのために同じ "
"`Optimizer` を返し、`run()`または `iterate()`で最適化を実行します。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:72
msgid ""
"Unconfigured components resolve to their defaults. Set multi-objective "
"ranking by choosing one of the following Comparators."
msgstr "未設定のコンポーネントはデフォルトに解決されます。 多目的の順位付けは、次のComparatorの選択で設定します。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:75
msgid "Choose a comparator"
msgstr "Comparatorを選ぶ"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:77
msgid ""
"In multi-objective optimization, `Comparator` decides the relative "
"superiority between candidate solutions."
msgstr "多目的最適化では、`Comparator` が候補解同士の相対的な優劣を決めます。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:79
msgid ""
"If `Problem`'s `comparator` argument is omitted, one is auto-selected "
"based on the number of objectives (`SingleObjectiveComparator` when "
"`n_obj == 1`, `NSGA2Comparator` when `n_obj > 1`)."
msgstr ""
"`Problem` の `comparator` 引数を省略すると、目的数に基づいて自動選択されます（`n_obj == 1` では "
"`SingleObjectiveComparator`、`n_obj > 1` では `NSGA2Comparator`）。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:16
msgid "Class"
msgstr "クラス"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:16
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "動作"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:16
msgid "`NSGA2Comparator`"
msgstr "`NSGA2Comparator`"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:16
msgid ""
"Diversity maintenance via non-dominated sorting and crowding distance "
"(default)"
msgstr "非劣ソートと混雑度距離による多様性維持（既定）"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:16
msgid "`SPEA2Comparator`"
msgstr "`SPEA2Comparator`"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:16
msgid "Fitness based on strength of dominance and neighborhood density"
msgstr "支配の強さと近傍密度に基づく適応度"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:16
msgid "`HypervolumeComparator`"
msgstr "`HypervolumeComparator`"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:16
msgid "Superiority judged by hypervolume contribution"
msgstr "ハイパーボリューム寄与で優劣を判定"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:16
msgid "`EpsilonDominanceComparator`"
msgstr "`EpsilonDominanceComparator`"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:16
msgid "Superiority judged by epsilon-dominance"
msgstr "ε支配で優劣を判定"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:16
msgid "`NSGA3Comparator`"
msgstr "`NSGA3Comparator`"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:16
msgid "Diversity maintenance via reference points. Requires `reference_points`"
msgstr "参照点による多様性維持。`reference_points` が必要です"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:16
msgid "`RNSGA2Comparator`"
msgstr "`RNSGA2Comparator`"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:16
msgid ""
"Concentrates solutions near specified reference points. Requires "
"`reference_points`"
msgstr "指定した参照点の近くに解を集中させます。`reference_points` が必要です"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:90
msgid "`comparator` can be swapped as an attribute of the `Problem` instance."
msgstr "`Problem` インスタンスの属性として `comparator` を交換できます。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:99
msgid "Extract the Pareto front"
msgstr "Paretoフロントを取得する"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:101
msgid "After running, `result.ctx.pareto_archive` holds the final Pareto front."
msgstr "実行後、最終的なParetoフロントは `result.ctx.pareto_archive` に保持されます。"

#: ../../tutorials/multi_objective.md:108
msgid ""
"To compute the Pareto front from an arbitrary array of objective values, "
"you can use `non_dominated_sort` directly."
msgstr "任意の目的値配列からParetoフロントを計算するには、`non_dominated_sort` を直接使えます。"

